  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4df0014cb02a0cf4bbbc7addabd2224a, type: 3}
  m_Name: MainDialogue2NG+
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Now, my friend, you are a bit stronger, thanks to me!
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: And since it's because of none other than yours truly that you are still
      alive and kickin', I think we can establish that you are in my debt. Right?
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: And since you're in my debt, I'm gonna need a liiiiiiiiittle favor from
      you. Tiny I swear.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: 'Ya see, I''mma let you in a little secret. '
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: I'm not really a pig.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: ...
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: I feel like that's not new info for you.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: "I'm feeling d\xE9j\xE0 vu."
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Anyways, it turns out there is a mushroom here in this forest that could
      help me turn back to my human form.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: There's just a little catch. The mushroom is actually alive and...not friendly.
      And I need 15 of them. Also, there may be other not-friendly things lurking
      around. Sooo...
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: 'That''s where you come in! '
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Now, there's a good side to all of this. Mushroom dudes also drop ingredients
      that serve as weapon upgrades, and those purple orbs! So you might as well
      get stronger from it.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Since you never say anything, I'll just assume you're super on board with
      this.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Now go, my silent friend! Follow this path and you'll find the mean mushrooms.
      Good luck!
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: I would tell you how to use the dash and all, but...seems like that would
      be useless.
